# Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies is sent to the builder, so .env, data/,
# cookies, keys or local databases can never end up in the build context or an image layer.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!src/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
# defense in depth, in case someone adds a broad COPY later
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.sqlite*
**/cookies*.txt
